                                          7824
                                          7825  # Instruction COPYN (35 cf nn)
                                          7826  # * Copy nn bytes from [T3] to [T2].
                                          7827  # * Handles page crossings. Peak rate 10 bytes/scanline.
                                          7828  # * On return, T3 and T2 contain the next addresses.
                                          7829  # * N:Cycles 1:58 2:84 3:110 4:84 5:112 6:138 7:164 8:138
                                          7830  # * Origin: this is an improved version of the copy
                                          7831  #   opcode I wrote for ROMvX0.
